{"title":"1996 AJHSME Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_5\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 5</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_5\">Problem 5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The letters <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/9866e3a998d628ba0941eb4fea0666ac391d149a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/f/eff43e84f8a3bcf7b6965f0a3248bc4d3a9d0cd4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/5/2554b6496c3b678897e9b060ef00aa9f0a7d7ece.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$T$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> represent numbers located on the number line as shown.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/9/8992c6d2efe4e3e9810fb5e24eeb698bbb7a86eb.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] unitsize(36); draw((-4,0)--(4,0)); draw((-3.9,0.1)--(-4,0)--(-3.9,-0.1)); draw((3.9,0.1)--(4,0)--(3.9,-0.1));  for (int i = -3; i &lt;= 3; ++i) {     draw((i,-0.1)--(i,0)); } label(&quot;$-3$&quot;,(-3,-0.1),S); label(&quot;$-2$&quot;,(-2,-0.1),S); label(&quot;$-1$&quot;,(-1,-0.1),S); label(&quot;$0$&quot;,(0,-0.1),S); label(&quot;$1$&quot;,(1,-0.1),S); label(&quot;$2$&quot;,(2,-0.1),S); label(&quot;$3$&quot;,(3,-0.1),S);  draw((-3.7,0.1)--(-3.6,0)--(-3.5,0.1)); draw((-3.6,0)--(-3.6,0.25)); label(&quot;$P$&quot;,(-3.6,0.25),N); draw((-1.3,0.1)--(-1.2,0)--(-1.1,0.1)); draw((-1.2,0)--(-1.2,0.25)); label(&quot;$Q$&quot;,(-1.2,0.25),N); draw((0.1,0.1)--(0.2,0)--(0.3,0.1)); draw((0.2,0)--(0.2,0.25)); label(&quot;$R$&quot;,(0.2,0.25),N); draw((0.8,0.1)--(0.9,0)--(1,0.1)); draw((0.9,0)--(0.9,0.25)); label(&quot;$S$&quot;,(0.9,0.25),N); draw((1.4,0.1)--(1.5,0)--(1.6,0.1)); draw((1.5,0)--(1.5,0.25)); label(&quot;$T$&quot;,(1.5,0.25),N); [/asy]\" width=\"482\" height=\"72\" />\n</p><p>Which of the following expressions represents a negative number?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/6/906f5c70fb610b08a9aa3f02a30e1fb41851f8d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ P-Q \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ P\\cdot Q \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ \\dfrac{S}{Q}\\cdot P \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ \\dfrac{R}{P\\cdot Q} \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ \\dfrac{S+T}{R}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"519\" height=\"41\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>First, note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/d/94dc8d70a1aaac2821b6a3bae3d192bf3deb2e06.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P &lt; Q &lt; 0 &lt; R &lt; S &lt; T$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"198\" height=\"16\" />.  Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/9866e3a998d628ba0941eb4fea0666ac391d149a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"18\" /> are negative, while <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/f/eff43e84f8a3bcf7b6965f0a3248bc4d3a9d0cd4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/5/2554b6496c3b678897e9b060ef00aa9f0a7d7ece.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$T$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> are positive.\n</p><p>Option <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> is the difference of two numbers.  If the first number is lower than the second number, the answer will be negative.  In this case, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/2/fe2a1470298d7b55b7eb9cce93143d8d58836020.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P &lt; Q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"52\" height=\"16\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/e/6ced4f558d542f245d6caf72800de6c4ebb6e9a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P - Q &lt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"83\" height=\"16\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/3/7b364cfe85eb69f81bd5a042b77aea34257508b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P-Q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"50\" height=\"16\" /> is thus indeed a negative number.  So option <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/e/f6eb65962292d994ce2f9a8af63728883f256b18.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{A}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"27\" height=\"25\" /> is correct.\n</p><p>Option <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> is the product of two negatives, which is always positive.\n</p><p>Option <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> starts with the quotient of a positive and a negative.  This is negative.  But this negative quotient is then multiplied by a negative number, which gives a positive number.\n</p><p>Option <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> has the product of two negatives in the denominator.  Thus, the denominator is positive.  Additionally, the numerator is (barely) positive.  A positive over a positive will be positive.\n</p><p>Option <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> has the sum of two positives in the numerator.   That will be positive.  The denominator is also positive.  Again, the quotient of two positives is positive.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Estimate the numbers, and calculate.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/c/9dc4ab8e0cef478dc693bed739aa8e58af6bcdd0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P\\approx -3.5$\" width=\"75\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/2/89282684a5446696a257928f6bc356e3ef0fde65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q\\approx -1.1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"74\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/8/b683f52164f84bca365dc2ecf8fec1d2cd63ab0e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R\\approx 0.1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"60\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/b/7cb00cf943e1cc91018cae026a2db8ed5a2a3e5f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S\\approx 0.9$\" width=\"59\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/e/a6eeffccafe53a951912bc546ebe280da1256410.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$T\\approx 1.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"62\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>For option <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />, the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/b/6fb87ca0d13f3c4af7a15264fada12ee8d8475b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P - Q = -3.5 - (-1.1) = -3.5 + 1.1 = -2.4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"354\" height=\"18\" />.  Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/e/f6eb65962292d994ce2f9a8af63728883f256b18.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{A}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"27\" height=\"25\" /> is the right answer.\n</p><p>For option <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/b/b6bfe77887e0766fc09fbabffaa68995ce893483.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PQ = -3.5 \\cdot -1.1 = +3.85$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"210\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>For option <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/4/804627db2e2156e548da9992c3a766dc2c961392.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{S}{Q}\\cdot P = \\frac{0.9}{-1.1}\\cdot -3.5 \\approx -0.818 \\cdot -3.5 \\approx +2.836$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"371\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p>For option <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/7/5d7cb567677412bf9f5d1d4ac45c39c7bf3877c8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{R}{PQ} = \\frac{0.1}{3.85} \\approx +0.026$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"172\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p>For option <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/9/e79e9d723611b4244bad996a02885abf7935aec2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{S+T}{R} = \\frac{0.9 + 1.5}{0.1} = \\frac{2.4}{0.1} = +24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"256\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME\" title=\"1996 AJHSME\">1996 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1996 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1996 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1996\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1996 AJHSME Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1996 AJHSME Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1996 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1996 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1996 AJHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1996 AJHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1996 AJHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1996 AJHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1996 AJHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1996 AJHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1996 AJHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1996 AJHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1996 AJHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1996 AJHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1996 AJHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1996 AJHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1996 AJHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1996 AJHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1996 AJHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1996 AJHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1996 AJHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1996 AJHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1996 AJHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1996 AJHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1996 AJHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1996 AJHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_8_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 8 Problems and Solutions\"> All AJHSME/AMC 8 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AJHSME\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"AJHSME\">AJHSME</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AJHSME_Problems_and_Solutions\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"AJHSME Problems and Solutions\">AJHSME Problems and Solutions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_competition_resources\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mathematics competition resources\">Mathematics competition resources</a></li></ul>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261016222917\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.037 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.056 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 256/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2298/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 128/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 7923/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   12.008      1 -total\n 57.95%    6.959      1 Template:AJHSME_box\n 40.18%    4.825      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:9928:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261016222917 and revision id 55715. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}